        "description": "Lower lip pits or mucous membrane pits",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of popliteal pterygium and orofacial clefts, with or without additional minor features",
    "notes": "Genetic testing for IRF6 mutations can support diagnosis but is not mandatory."
